{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "e0fad03af6e8de37a8c26641a8e6df4c9db0b3cec8cb4bb2dc12126505903667", "ja": "彼女が過ごす健やかな日々", "zh": "她度过的安康日常", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "27455d00d91ff5238f9b3e17de62d371eea454ba52c7c13039d468ffb793ee99", "ja": "麗花との入れ替わり初日。志保は大学へ行\nき、麗花の『やることリスト』をこなす。\n拍子抜けするほど簡単に『大人の生活』を\n終えた志保は麗花の部屋で一人、\n静かな夜に物寂しさを感じるのだった。", "zh": "和丽花互换身份的第一天。志保去了大学，\n完成丽花的“待办事项清单”。\n志保轻松得出乎意料地结束了“成年人的生活”，\n独自在丽花的房间里，\n于寂静的夜晚感受到了寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1000_null", "source_sha256": "57f684d7a5cf97e0e7f02b67ac6f19ef7a436678c0da85ca59f7b6d48a09564c", "ja": "―入れ替わり当日　side志保―", "zh": "―互换身体当天　side志保―", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1001_033sih", "source_sha256": "315f678e5a59cd6e92545062930762007340a73fa7dba4901d0f68812ec99888", "ja": "（本当に来ちゃった。ここが、麗花さんの学校……。\n大学って、こんなに大きいんだ）", "zh": "（真的来了。这里就是丽花的学校……\n大学原来这么大啊）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "0894214f90f5e6f1a27038ff69e95be0915cfc66c95ccf38d1b0ed15dbaad181", "ja": "（えっと、やること確認しておかなくちゃ。\n確か麗花さんのメールには……）", "zh": "（那个，我得先确认一下要做的事。\n记得丽花小姐的邮件里……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "5e74f99288a21ecb3dfb7d7a18d122f6c0ff5cc65ea141c246431f5482794fd6", "ja": "『☆北上麗花　本日のやることリスト☆\n友達にノートを返す♪　演劇サークルのお手伝い♪』", "zh": "『☆北上丽花　今日待办清单☆\n还朋友笔记本♪　去戏剧社帮忙♪』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "97175e9329a08d1472fc9bafb188392405c2300632ba36f5dc123534ff476cb7", "ja": "（……これぐらいなら多分、大丈夫だと思うけど。\nただ……）", "zh": "（……这种程度的话，应该没问题吧。\n只是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "d0e6c626d2981fa397758ffb37acd35ee29f8f7912966a5376c2088ea93111f0", "ja": "（大学って、勝手に入っていいのかな。一応、関係者\n……かもしれないけど、学生じゃないのに……）", "zh": "（大学可以随便进去吗？姑且算是相关人员……也说不定，可我明明不是学生……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1006_daigakusei", "source_sha256": "a8d7e6c223f990341a041408113c7b9433d6cd90e84818954c0169f377ac1afa", "ja": "ねえ、君どうしたの？　大学に何か用事？", "zh": "你怎么了？是去大学有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1007_033sih", "source_sha256": "1738e9957c7a932f82f638c07f15b6b78d998911dafa94368f717e62f0850ba6", "ja": "は、はい。\nここって、私が入っても大丈夫なんでしょうか？", "zh": "是、是的。\n我进去这里真的没关系吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1008_daigakusei", "source_sha256": "840a7787350c3cd9f4a7fbed5158e4ab7c0a30ef87ab8d137610641c96186103", "ja": "ああ、それなら大丈夫。うちは屋外見学自由で、\n子連れで遊びに来てる人もいるぐらいだから。", "zh": "啊，那样的话就没问题。我们这里可以自由参观户外区域，甚至还有带孩子来游玩的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "0f00b297f79b3bccc8caf4011092f5489fad1baea174dcb2e08289fd9658b8fa", "ja": "そうなんですね……。\nあ、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "原来如此……\n啊，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1010_daigakusei", "source_sha256": "0110a669828f221cd79705a929e6c85b63f221d2c7b44fef52b62e429ed03822", "ja": "いいえ～。どうぞ楽しんで行ってね！", "zh": "不客气～请好好玩个痛快吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1011_033sih", "source_sha256": "9f8e8e01c10a929ecbf66c2bf039f7b4b799748b58fee7a146475ae009ec4f6f", "ja": "……大学って、そんな感じなんだ。\nりっくんと遊べるような場所もあるのかな。", "zh": "……原来大学是那种感觉啊。\n不知道有没有能和小陆一起玩的地方呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "c57e51b8077b3612603c9da32d1bb781ffe30542c45cb4cbe3fd4b9efde3e7a6", "ja": "よし。とりあえず、ノートを返すところから……。", "zh": "好。总之，先从归还笔记本开始……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1013_enngekisakurunogakusei", "source_sha256": "17e8e7cb872583a83c59d324ebf2ac465a0df413dac7bac500e1268f52527b8a", "ja": "志保ちゃん、今日はありがとう！\nプロの意見が聞けて、すごく参考になったよ。", "zh": "志保，今天谢谢你！\n能听到专业人士的意见，真的很有参考价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "99c44f70bab19baf371bef6d1dd6890400ba679392654e1f8754f13d7cd1d1b3", "ja": "いえ、私こそ勉強になりました。仕事とは全然違う\n舞台のつくり方で……、刺激的でした。", "zh": "不会，我才受教了。这种舞台的构建方式\n和工作时截然不同……很有启发。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1015_enngekisakurunogakusei", "source_sha256": "fcf5d5cf98e8a69d1d4e49682333ea581a1a3b29bd9c44e7d0c3656a0b931dfd", "ja": "まぁ、商業よりは制約がないし、\n仲間と好き勝手できるのは楽しいと思うよ！", "zh": "不过，比起商业演出限制要少，能和伙伴们随心所欲地做自己喜欢的事，我觉得很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1016_enngekisakurunogakusei", "source_sha256": "bcae45bde41f8994b8fa27a102d4ebce5cca05cfee4e609cdeda000fed1d328b", "ja": "よかったらまた遊びに来て。今度は麗花ちゃんと\n一緒に。それじゃ、気を付けて帰ってね！", "zh": "如果可以的话再来玩哦。下次和丽花\n一起。那么，路上小心回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "38147824564394ff9492239e2b0b8871fc9d54c44fdd9f56bb7e569673f7c4cb", "ja": "はい、ありがとうございます。", "zh": "好的，非常感谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "03a4ada727b35b211bf9cd2056a0a2024c19090f8fc51c1a5a9e2ab42f6cca27", "ja": "（……ふぅ。結構、長居しちゃった）", "zh": "（……呼。好像待得有点久了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1019_033sih", "source_sha256": "52e220ff93b977a8033b2d18b10eb41546534502b4d674f0a61f59e218a5bf74", "ja": "（でも……楽しかった。\nなんだか、自由だったな。大学生か……）", "zh": "（不过……很开心。\n总觉得，好自由啊。大学生吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1020_se", "source_sha256": "907f495885a55eeaf98bc4c8a34896eab7df057cf196127a3c72505bcd514114", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ、ブーッ", "zh": "嘟——、嘟——、嘟——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1021_033sih", "source_sha256": "bf260e552076fd804b69e831ead2f09a3300a1f75f4ae941c584810b59da7df4", "ja": "メール……あ、麗花さんね。\nえっと、次にやることは……。", "zh": "邮件……啊，是丽花。\n那个，接下来要做的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "effc238177f1ae8aed530a0f80a11e6571b7a898473e55a8fc9754b2ba199864", "ja": "『公園をお散歩して、（暗くなる前に帰ること！）\nスーパーでお惣菜を買ってね♪（お酒はNG！）』", "zh": "『去公园散散步，（要在天黑前回去哦！）\n去超市买熟食♪（不可以买酒！）』", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "f4143202048aec4416c3d3a0d8b3aa5f0cbfeaf95e27e744fb5d166ddc5dffb6", "ja": "散歩……麗花さんらしいな。", "zh": "散步……真像丽花小姐的风格啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "ac431fcc25ca2c5e2f83a72be70ba1ccb02884b8ad19703a783cd87009c75a48", "ja": "（でもそっか。大学生……二十歳になったら\nお酒も飲めるんだ。夜までの散歩も……）", "zh": "（不过这样啊。大学生……等到二十岁，就能喝酒了。散步到晚上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "949601caf2e66106911bc1e0cf41a8cfdafdb1bc4e83247f5f205848ae4262d5", "ja": "（なんだか、変な感じ）", "zh": "（总觉得，好奇怪的感觉。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "952a511f41921aac66e58b37084cdfeb6b373b9e75b1819f630ecba3f04e57d6", "ja": "麗花さん、いつもどんなお惣菜買ってるんだろう。\n……聞いてみようかな。", "zh": "不知道丽花小姐平时都买些什么熟食呢。\n……要不要问问她呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "8651ca5f4299b23710459e4ae4fb02cf4d73b668c56036220258840a330654d6", "ja": "ごちそうさまでした。\nふぅ…………。", "zh": "多谢款待。\n呼…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1028_033sih", "source_sha256": "93ad8bad8313fe08a70929ee1692ed278892ed897404a0175e538f7b866e5b0a", "ja": "まだ7時なんだ……。\nいつもは帰ってから寝るまで、あっという間なのに。", "zh": "才7点啊……\n平时从回家到睡觉，明明转眼就过去了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "765b2036c7282776a1120d670fbf83a18f38d57c59301b058338fb7534ad642a", "ja": "（寝るまでは自由時間って言ってたけど、何しよう。\n部屋の片づけは禁止って言われてるし……）", "zh": "（虽然说睡觉前都是自由时间，可要做什么呢。还被告知禁止收拾房间……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1031_se", "source_sha256": "907f495885a55eeaf98bc4c8a34896eab7df057cf196127a3c72505bcd514114", "ja": "ブーッ、ブーッ、ブーッ", "zh": "嘟——、嘟——、嘟——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "bebb44f9bf0f826c808eb1dd49473b73f9291373c94369207accddcd9843fa08", "ja": "メール……えっと、\nご飯のあとは一人でジェンガがおすすめ……？", "zh": "邮件……呃，\n推荐饭后一​​个人玩叠叠乐……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "b708678821273fff23ffda399a2df946cbb97d17ad6b4343f6ab7e4edce2dc26", "ja": "……とりあえず、やってみよう。\nえっと……まずは、ジェンガを見つけなくちゃ。", "zh": "……总之，先试试看吧。\n唔……首先，得把层层叠找出来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "d384bf9c9815678691ee4c779a700f09e7a5d3c6f295ac7a99a5d940dd8ff203", "ja": "ふわ……思ったより集中しちゃった。\nパズルの一種と思えば、結構楽しいのかも。", "zh": "呼……没想到会比预想中更专注。\n把它当成一种益智游戏的话，说不定还挺有意思的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "07e95b8f4a1514374d5e9e15d6f267ff3d8cf6a3ce8e77be77cf9b66fb13e04b", "ja": "（今日は、不思議な一日だったな。大学生の\n一人暮らしなんて、大人の生活と思ってたけど……）", "zh": "（今天真是不可思议的一天啊。原本以为大学生一个人生活，会是成年人的生活……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "d45b9086910fa1cb3fec72dfaa3697212da1efee2fa43155973325b1ac6fdf12", "ja": "（案外、普通の生活って感じ。授業受けて、\nサークルに行って……、家事も一人分だけ）", "zh": "（感觉意外地就是普通的生活。上上课，去参加社团……家务也只需做一人份）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0396_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0396_story_03_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "e653c592a90c1ecbd76008c8173f0e1bab0077333c41887213dad632c8fd467e", "ja": "でも……私には、一人暮らしはまだ早いみたい。\n……ね、お母さん。……りっくん。", "zh": "不过……看来对我来说，一个人生活还太早了。\n……对吧，妈妈。……小陆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
